<title>USA: Klamath First Bancorp sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Klamath First Bancorp sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>KLAMATH FALLS, Ore 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Klamath First Bancorp Inc said the company will initiate a program to repurchase up to 1,161,247 or 10 percent of the company's outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>This stock repurchase program has been authorized by the company's board of directors and approved by the Office of Thrift Supervision, the company's primary regulator.</p>
<p>The repurchase is anticipated to begin after December 23, 1996, and end by October 4, 1997.</p>
<p>The company's shares closed unchanged at 15.</p>
</text>
